commendationid": "199240671", "author": {"steamid": "76561198108611132", "personaname": "CowsRMajestic", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198108611132/", "num_games_owned": 139, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 5074, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3860, "last_played": 1778033020, "avatar": "61d643bc67bdfedfeb7a93079990e662f619ea34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Goat Man! I'm dancing in your arena! It's my arena now! If you want me out of this arena you're going to have to kill me!", "timestamp_created": 1751929327, "timestamp_updated": 1751929327, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199240660", "author": {"steamid": "76561198262557444", "personaname": "Fat Boy Yoshi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198262557444/", "num_games_owned": 244, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 8080, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4433, "last_played": 1788854037, "avatar": "d17608d8087493fc84def3a940aaff10751edd5d"}, "language": "english", "review": "🔥🔥", "timestamp_created": 1751929315, "timestamp_updated": 1751929315, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199240187", "author": {"steamid": "76561199368798253", "personaname": "JOHNNY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199368798253/", "num_games_owned": 43, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 10646, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3733, "last_played": 1773441549, "avatar": "6423eb6ef1cd518a306d457a74adec6ad1166b71"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1751928811, "timestamp_updated": 1751928811, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199240157", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001522349", "personaname": "Ashton Clutcher", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198001522349/", "num_games_owned": 188, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 3480, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 444, "last_played": 1777432172, "avatar": "e4c2321e90c139f3a3719c7ce3679d57e17de73d"}, "language": "english", "review": "To preface, I will say I only have less than 10 hours in the game for now so it will not be a truly substantive take on the game, but as someone who has experienced other titles, like Dark Souls 3 and Elden Ring, I can say this game is definitely worth it for anyone who enjoys a similar pace or style of edgy games that keep you on your seat. With that said, here are the pros and cons I've found:\r\n\r\n+ Detailed gothic horror game built around the Elden Ring universe, with lots of elements combining together to create an RPG masterpiece similar to other titles (some changes and fixes to the game could help but nothing crazy yet)\r\n+ Characters are interesting and unique in their own ways, with special abilities and interactions that help you see their personality come to life (even if they seem like the usual mundane figures from other games)\r\n+ Map is quite massive and has a lot of creatures and mobs to hunt and kill while roaming around\r\n+ Good game for fans of battle royale-style games, including Fortnite, Hunt: Showdown, and Apex, in which you loot stuff around maps and check the open world map areas and see what you need to do for objectives to keep moving away from the threat of \"storm circles\"\r\n+ Fun to pick up, hard to master features that will keep players invested for a long time to learn and grind with\r\n+ Various weapon types and lots of interesting facets to help build each character individually too\r\n+ More than one person per team can pick the same character, allowing for each person to enjoy who they want to play as\r\n\r\n- The game is still growing and going along, so there's a lot of visual clutter or laggy bugs in certain places that can alter gameplay for some people drastically\r\n- There's some risky bugs from what I've seen and heard on Steam forums about the game randomly crashing out or causing file corruption issues, forcing players to reinstall or wipe all their progress without consent and making them start all over again (could be a huge dealbreaker for some people who play this game as it follows a similar trend from past titles)\r\n- The game has a very difficult learning curve and does NOT hold your hand, even if you've played the other games before. Keep in mind that this game is from the same universe as other games where difficulty levels are usually higher than in other games, thus making some players rage quit in between\r\n- Not enough variety of characters aside from base ones and a small few to unlock from progression and story content, making the game a bit lackluster in this department (not that big of a deal though)\r\n- Players can pick the same character as you, creating a bit of an annoyance if one likes diversity or \"standing out from the crowd\"\r\n- Item builds and relic system are a bit weird at times and can be adjusted or reworked better to suit more slots or options (I'm still learning this system though myself so I could be wrong on this and perhaps it is already perfectly designed, but who knows)\r\n\r\nAll in all, I do recommend this game to anyone who loves horror and satisfying RPG combat with an immersive dark environment and creepy monsters everywhere to slay!", "timestamp_created": 1751928783, "timestamp_updated": 1751928783, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199240048", "author": {"steamid": "76561198101243334", "personaname": "Giuseppe Stromboli", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198101243334/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 14522, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2425, "last_played": 1767080547, "avatar": "5170ba9f1de4eefc433f2445c217928915919bed"}, "language": "english", "review": "bonk", "timestamp_created": 1751928649, "timestamp_updated": 1751928649, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199240031", "author": {"steamid": "76561199009253328", "personaname": "Naikuma", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/naikuma/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 10084, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7113, "last_played": 1783110364, "avatar": "c1841bfd4ebf7817b882f636155a25f65097fe09"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game got me HOOKED like a drug addict on crack! So so fun to play! So much stuff to do! Certainly has flaws, but it seems like developers are slowly but surely polish